            {
                "entry_id": "378887ef-e06b-3dae-b52d-acb198213ca8",
                "word": "bavure",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "1628c082-ccb5-4a1e-ae2f-0e436943f970",
                        "entry_id": "378887ef-e06b-3dae-b52d-acb198213ca8",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "bavures"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "44444f33-965e-341e-bfe6-963a6b1d8587",
                        "entry_id": "378887ef-e06b-3dae-b52d-acb198213ca8",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Petite trace que les joints des pièces d’un moule laissent sur l’objet moulé."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d90b069e-a016-4950-9c68-476f60d4afaf",
                                "sense_id": "44444f33-965e-341e-bfe6-963a6b1d8587",
                                "text": "Enlever les bavures."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "2b4a95c4-73ca-3d07-9793-1e955bb5737d",
                        "entry_id": "378887ef-e06b-3dae-b52d-acb198213ca8",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Trace d’encre s’étalant en dehors d’un dessin ou du motif d’une lettre lors de l’impression ou de l’écriture."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "analogy"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "98e4c1e8-5fd1-4a34-b480-415e55926df9",
                                "sense_id": "2b4a95c4-73ca-3d07-9793-1e955bb5737d",
                                "text": "Ma plume hésite, puis échappe à ma main noueuse, laissant une bavure d’encre sur le papier de Geairepu. Encore une feuille de ce fin matériau gâchée, dans une entreprise que je soupçonne fort d'être vaine."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "4105c589-137b-3260-9eca-b464b83c4cf4",
                        "entry_id": "378887ef-e06b-3dae-b52d-acb198213ca8",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Action erronée aux répercussions graves."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "slang"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0505674a-a307-4b75-adc8-353df6aa8289",
                                "sense_id": "4105c589-137b-3260-9eca-b464b83c4cf4",
                                "text": "Qui sera responsable en cas de bavure d'une IA militaire?"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "52085ffb-dfe9-383a-b2d4-be9f19f2e4ee",
                        "entry_id": "378887ef-e06b-3dae-b52d-acb198213ca8",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Bavure policière."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "especially"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "98401063-b269-41a3-9ace-50603d6e7fd1",
                                "sense_id": "52085ffb-dfe9-383a-b2d4-be9f19f2e4ee",
                                "text": "Au cœur des cités sensibles, je ne peux nier l'existence de « délits de sale gueule », de contrôles au faciès, d'interpellations arbitraires, de vexations et tutoiements inutiles. La bavure existe et les conditions de déroulement des gardes à vue peuvent laisser à désirer."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "051275da-44d2-4d97-9184-d8875879a0d6",
                                "sense_id": "52085ffb-dfe9-383a-b2d4-be9f19f2e4ee",
                                "text": "Jetez vos bâtons dans mes roues j'esquiverais,\nQuiconque qui dénoncera les bavures j'le suivrai"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "576518fb-9518-4f36-aae6-3f8fb0cc90a8",
                                "sense_id": "52085ffb-dfe9-383a-b2d4-be9f19f2e4ee",
                                "text": "Les reproductions du scénario bavure-émeute et la construction d’une mémoire collective conduisent, après 1990, à une solidification du signal telle que chaque bavure entraînera des réactions de violence collective."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "82b435e9-507d-450f-8ca6-5ce4140109e8",
                        "source_entry_id": "378887ef-e06b-3dae-b52d-acb198213ca8",
                        "source_sense_id": "2b4a95c4-73ca-3d07-9793-1e955bb5737d",
                        "source_sense_description": "(Par analogie) Trace d’encre s’étalant en dehors d’un dessin",
                        "target_lang_word": "smudge",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "smudge",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "19c23d4d-5bad-3943-9fe6-38b363379185",
                                        "entry_id": "2a60172b-7db9-385b-9e06-c2952d398378",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A blemish or smear, especially a dark or sooty one."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9d15bb4a-9edb-4e22-b094-44e7816aad73",
                                                "sense_id": "19c23d4d-5bad-3943-9fe6-38b363379185",
                                                "text": "There was a smudge on the paper."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "dfcf1097-9e7b-3eeb-8b1a-b68c6294a120",
                                        "entry_id": "2a60172b-7db9-385b-9e06-c2952d398378",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Dense smoke, such as that used for fumigation."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6167ccc6-48bd-3392-ac81-5003d34d9b76",
                                        "entry_id": "2a60172b-7db9-385b-9e06-c2952d398378",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A heap of damp combustibles partially ignited and burning slowly, placed on the windward side of a house, tent, etc. to keep off mosquitoes or other insects."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "US",
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "15a0eb4b-3547-4fe4-8df3-8c69918ed2eb",
                                                "sense_id": "6167ccc6-48bd-3392-ac81-5003d34d9b76",
                                                "text": "Then \"smudges\" are in vogue,—heaps of damp combustibles placed on the windward side of the house and partially ignited, that their inky steams may smother the mosquitoes while we take our chance. I have had a \"smudge\" made in a chafing-dish at my bedside, after a serious deliberation between choking and being devoured at small mouthfuls; and I conscientiously recommend choking, or running the risk of it, at least."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "99207e3a-36d0-43e8-8f0d-e1a340f8d31a",
                                                "sense_id": "6167ccc6-48bd-3392-ac81-5003d34d9b76",
                                                "text": "We had taken about ten pounds of trout; and the first procedure, after reaching the camp, was to build a smudge or smoke-fire, to drive away these abominable gnats, who, fortunately, take flight with the first whiff of smoke."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "35a02aff-52c3-4af2-83f3-560293f740b6",
                                                "sense_id": "6167ccc6-48bd-3392-ac81-5003d34d9b76",
                                                "text": "The use of smoke (or \"smudges\") against the attack of the mosquito is well understood in America and elsewhere."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "45304c48-3748-32d2-b63b-d02f48b5ac95",
                                        "entry_id": "2a60172b-7db9-385b-9e06-c2952d398378",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A quantity of herbs used in suffumigation."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "especially",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8cac0393-cb56-4b44-b81f-9aa79fc3c88d",
                                                "sense_id": "45304c48-3748-32d2-b63b-d02f48b5ac95",
                                                "text": "Devil's dirt or asafetida ground together with fenugreek and black cumin seed is used as a smudge against witches and […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "smudge",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e4627aa2-8f93-3814-ac8c-bf08d7d05d81",
                                        "entry_id": "ac97b7ac-f8a7-3b2f-b3c2-8fbe04513d67",
